**National SEO is search work for a business that sells across the whole UK or runs many branches. It targets service and category searches with no town in them. It also structures location pages so each branch can win local searches. It suits multi-location service businesses, franchises, ecommerce brands and B2B firms. I run it as an independent consultant. Retainers start at £1,500 per month. The usual starting point is a free 20-minute diagnosis or a £495 technical SEO audit.**

I own the strategy myself. You deal with me directly rather than an account manager.

