## Frequently asked questions

### Do I need a separate page for every town I serve?

No. Create a page only where you have a real branch or a staffed service area with facts specific to it. Pages that only swap the town name risk breaking Google's doorway policy.

### Can you manage Google Business Profiles for franchisees?

Yes, given the right access. I set the standards, check every profile monthly and give franchisees a short checklist for reviews and updates.

### How long does national SEO take?

Technical fixes can show in weeks. Category and authority work usually takes several months to show in national rankings.

My guide
 on [how long SEO takes](/blog/how-long-does-seo-take/) explains the stages.

